requirement_id: "REQ-impl-native-transition"
reason: "Clause-scoped ELF-entry/cut, symbolic-origin, alignment, permission, value/provenance, ownership and refusal tests support the conditional transition checker. Origin/alignment properties and sampled concrete ISA/byte oracles cover bounded populations and share instruction decoding; they do not establish the complete six-clause invariant conjunction. Successor-transition composition is not implemented, so its implication and same-origin/state obligations remain spec-only. No implementation contradiction is asserted. The certificate supplies no actual process-entry, bootstrap, source-storage association or runtime-reuse authority."
